description: After each prompt that changes the project, commit, push, and deploy
alwaysApply: true
---

# Ship after every prompt

When a prompt changes project files, finish by shipping that work:

1. Commit the change. Leave secrets out (`.env*`, credentials, `.vercel`).
2. Push `main` to `origin`.
3. Deploy production with `vercel deploy --prod --yes`.

Skip the commit and push when there is nothing new to commit. Deploy after a push that contains site changes. Never force-push and never skip hooks.
